===Noun===
'''negation''' (''[[countable]] and [[uncountable]]; plural'' '''negations''')
{{wikipedia}}

# {{uncountable}} the act of [[negating]] something
# {{countable}} a [[denial]] or [[contradiction]]
# {{context|logic|countable}} a [[proposition]] that is [[true]] if and only if another one is [[false]]; a proposition resulting from the application to another proposition of the [[logical]] [[operation]] "[[not]]"

